<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timotewo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa lya uvili lya Paulo kwa Timotewo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timotewo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa lya uvili lya Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Timotewo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa iyi lya uvili kwa Timotewo ndi ikasimbilwa na Mnjagila Paulo kuhelela kwa Timoteo yeakali muwulanichwa vake. Baluwa lya uvili kwa Timotewo ikasimbilwe muchipindi kya Paulo peakali pepi na kufuwa. Muchipindi iki Paulo akali mukiwopo mu mwani va Loma musula lya 1.16. Paulo akali mganja va Timotewo ngita lukolo mpaka Paulo akali akumkemela mwana vake, Filipi musula lya 2.22, 1 Timoteo musula lya 1.2, 1.18.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa iyi ndi yimwi cha chitai kuhuma kwa Paulo chechisimbilwe kwa vanu vakefu badili lya lipinga lya vamdikile Kilisito. Baluwa chingi chidatu ndi 1 Timoteo na Tito na Filimoni. Chipindi baluwa lya uvili kwa Timotewo peisimbilwe, vanu vamdikile Kilisito mu Dola lya Kilumi vakali vegudiswa kwa kuva lya udikilo vawo. Ivecha Paulo iyi nde kwakuva yeimgitile mukiwopo na akamnamacha Timoteo ahuvilile peichumba mumagudo. Ngita peyali mu baluwa lya kwanja kwa Timoteo, Paulo akamgavila Timoteo malakilo gyolofu kutigila vawulanichi va udesi 1 Timotewo musula lya 1.16-18. Kangi akumlongela Timotewo kuva pautalo lya lugedo dakuvecha na chipindi kikangafu na cha magudo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo ivanga kwa baluwa lyake kwa kumuhungila Timotewo musula lya 1.1-2 na kumnamacha musula lya 1.3-18.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akumlongela hilo Timotewo kuhuvulila magudo musula lya 2.1-13.</para>
  <para style="io">Pambele akumgavila malagilicho gangi musula lya 2.14-26.</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi akumlongela pakyanya lya njowo chichihumila pambele na kumwonesa ng'asi nofu lya kuyepa nagyo musula lya 3.1—4.8.</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo emalila kwa kwilonga yumwene musula lya 4.9-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Nene Paulo, Nguluvi akelile ndiveche mnjagila va Yesu Kilisito, neke ndiulandulile wula wumi wetukalogiwe mukwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Ndikusimbilila veve mwana vangu yendikukeliye Timotewo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Ndikung'ang'ila usangi na lusungu na lutengamaso kuhuma kwa Nguluvi Daada na Mtwa vetu Kilisito Yesu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhongecha na kunamacha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Ndikumuhongecha Nguluvi, yendikumgumbanikila kwa numbula nofu ngita pevagitile vagogolo vangu, ndikumhongecha kila pendiwiwuka pendikumsuka Nguluvi pamunyi na pamiye. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Ndiviwuka mahochi gako na ndikela hilo kukulola, neke ndiveche na lukeduko. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Ndikwiwuka udikilo lwako lwa undakyene, udikilo weakali navo paapo vako Loisi na maye vako Eunike. Ndichela kuva ata veve ugehe nalyo. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ndena ndikukwiwusa uyigumbanikile yila kipanji kyeugavilwe na Nguluvi chipindi pendikuvikiye mumawoko gyangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Kwakuva Muhe yetugavilwe na Nguluvi se vakutugita vawogofi haa, ila ndi Muhe va kutugavila lukelo na uginyange.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Bihile kulola nyoni kuvalongela vanu njowo cha Mtwa vetu, vala ubihile kundolela nyoni nene yendikali muwopwa kwajili lyake. Ila wiwunge mumagudo kwakuva lya Njowo Nofu, kwa ludali lwewigavilwa na Nguluvi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Mwene atulowe, akatukemela tuveche vanu vetuhaguliwe kwajili lya Nguluvi, Se kwakuva lya magito gyetu manofu, ila akagitile kwa lukelo lwake na usangi vake. Usangi uwu wetugavilwe na Kilisito Yesu inyi pehave kuvangichwa, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />ila nondee igubutuliwe kwa nefwe kwa kwacha kwake Mulowa vetu, Kilisito Yesu. Mwene kapecha ludali lwa kufuwa na kwa ng'asi lya Njowo Nofu kutugavila uwumi va mbepali.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Nene ndihaguliwe ndiveche mnjagila na muwulanichi na kudalika Njowo Nofu, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />na iyi nde kwakuva lya nene kuguda ndeni. Ila ndave ndigehe mkangafu, kwakuva ndikumchela mwene yendimwidikiye, kangi ndichela kuva mwene akukidima unofu kila ambakyo kikavikilwe pagati lyangu mbaka kigono kila kya kuhiga nogwa pekifikila. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Kolele unofu mawulanicho gala gya undakyene gendikuwulaniche na kusigala mu kwidikila na mulukelo weugehe kwa Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Njowo chila nofu lyeugavilwe ulidime kwa ludali lwa Muhe va Nguluvi yeikwikala mugati lyetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Ngita peuchela, vanu vonda va mwani va Asia vanilekile, mugati lyao vagehe Fugelo na Helimogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Mtwa awawonele lusungu vanu va kaye lya Onesifolo, kwakuva akandikedusile hilo numbula lyangu, vala seakawonile nyoni kwakuva ndikali mukiwopo, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />ila peafikile hela ku Loma, akavangile kunisaka hilo mpaka akaniwene. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Mtwa amtangile apatile lusungu lya Nguluvi mukigono kila! Na veve wichela unofu gonda gyeandigitile ukoya ku Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Mpuga mudikila va Kilisito Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Suwe, veve mwana vangu uveche na ludali mu usangi yetupatile kwa Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Tegule gala mawulanicho geunipulike pendidalika pautalo lya vaswida volofu, uvagavile vanu vevidikilwa, yeviwesa kuvawulanicha vanu vangi.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Ugude pamwi na nene ngita mpuga mwidikila va Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Mpuga mu fita akwinenga na kinu kyokyonda ambakyo sekyakipuga, neke kumkelesa mkomi va vapunga. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Ndeni ndeni kuhela munu yeisinda na kupata fupo lya kunyila ngita seikukolela malagicho gya mkino. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Mgima yeagitile kasi ngomi ndi eng'ang'wa kwanuka pono pa kwanja pa mabenelo. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Uhoche ago gyendikulongiye, kwakuva Mtwa akukutanga uveche kuchela finu fyonda.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Umuviwuke Yesu Kilisito yeachulumbuswe kuhuma kwa vanu vevafuwe, yeakali lukolo lwa Dawudi, ngita peilongwa mukiganulo kya Nguluvi lyendikuvadalikila. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Kwakuva Ndidalika Njowo Nofu, ndiguda na ata kuwopwa ndegeyi cha kyuma ngita wanganifu. Ila luchowo lya Nguluvi liwopwa ndegeyi cha kyuma hamu. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ndena ndihuvilila finu fyonda kwakuva lya yevahaguliwe na Nguluvi, neke na vawo vapate ulowa weugehe kwa Kilisito Yesu na wula wewileta ukomi va mbepali. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Luchowo ulu ndi lwa undakyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">Ngita tukafuwe pamwi na mwene</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">twikwikala uwumi pamwi na mwene.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Petukwendelela kuhuvilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">twitavala kangi pamwi na mwene.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Petukumlema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">na mwene akutulema<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Petwihela ludikilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">mwene isigala kuvecha mdikila mbepali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">kwakuva mwene seiwesa kwilema yumwene.<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mnyigedwa yeadikilwe na Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Suwe, vawiwuse vanu vako njowo ichi na kuvalakila pautalo lya Nguluvi vabihile kupinjana kwa makani gya upufi. Kupinjana ukoya seunofu, ila wileta uhanganifu mkomi kwa vala vevipulikicha. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Kangale kugita unofu neke Nguluvi akwidikile ngita mnyigendwa yeseilola nyoni pakyanya lya kasi lyake na yeiwulanicha unofu njowo cha undakyene. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Mwiyepe na malongano mawofu na gesegakumnjuma Nguluvi, kwakuva ago gagina kuvavika vanu patali na Nguluvi. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Mawulanicho ngita ago ndi ngita luma. Mugati va avo vevawulaniche ndi Humenayo na Fileto <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Ava vanyagiling'ine hilo na valekile undakyene, vakuvayaganicha vanu volofu vevidikiye kwa kulonga uchulubuko vetu ugitilwe suwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Ila kitamiko weuvikilwe na Nguluvi ndi ukangafu, pakyanya lyake gasimbilwe njowo ichi, “Mtwa akuvachela vala vevagehe vake,” Ndeni ndeni, “Kila yeilonga mwene ndi va Mtwa, nde ing'angwa aleke uwofu.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mukaye cha vamosi mugehe na fibakuli na finu fyonda, fingi ndi fesa na sahabu, fingi fya mibiki na mganga, fingi fya kugumbanikilwa kwa uginyange na finu fingi se figumbanikilwa kwa uginyange. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Suwe, ngita munu akwiwofoga kwa kwivika patali na njowo icho chonda chiwofu, daivecha kyombo kya kugumbanikila kya uginyange, kwakuva agehe unofu, akumkelesa Mtwa vake na agehe suwe kwa kasi yonda nofu. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Mwiyepe na udoboko chiwofu cha udimi, ufwate unofu, udikilo na ukelo na lutengamaso, pamwi na vanu vonda ambavo vakumlumba Mtwa kwa numbula nofu. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Mwiyepe malongo gya kidada kyesekikumkelesa Nguluvi na upufi, mwichela kuva ago huchovelecha ndewo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Mnyigendwa va Mtwa abihile kutovana, ila ing'ang'wa kuva mfokomasi kwa vanu vonda, muwulanichi msanzi na muhuvilila, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />yeing'ang'wa kuvawulanicha kwa ufokomasi vala vevakwipinga na mwene, iwesekana Nguluvi akavatanga vahogeche sambi chao na kuuchela undakyene. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Ndena, luhala lwao ukuvawunyila kangi, navo vawese kwilowa mumtambu va Setani yeavakwegile kwa kuvagita vidikie gala geisaka mwene.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Kigono kya mwiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Uviwuke kuva mufigono fya mwiso kwivecha na chipindi cha utumama. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Kwakuva vanu davakwikela vavene na vene kudoboka mafwani na vene kwidumba na vene kidada na vene kuliga na sevakuvaginya vasasi vawo na sevivecha na luhongecho na se vahaguliwe kwajili lya Nguluvi, <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />kangi, vihumila vanu vevihela lukelo munumbula chawo na vesevakuvalekela sambi vayawo na veviyovelecha ndewo na vevihela kigelo na vasugu na sevevikela unofu, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />vevakuvakana vayawo na vene kuvipa kisatu na vane kwidumba na vene kidada na vevikela unono kuchumba kumkela Nguluvi. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Vanu avo kwakuvalola daviwoneka ngita vanu vevakumginya Nguluvi, ila vakuulema ludali lwa undakyane lwa Nguluvi. Mwiyepe na vanu avo. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Vamonga vao hulelela mukaye cha vanu na kuvayovelecha vadala vasosuvafu vevihela udikilo na vene sambi na vilongochwa na udoboko uwofu vonda, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />vadala ambavo vigecha kwiwulanicha figono fyonda, ila seviwesa haa kuchela undakyene. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Vanu avo huwupinja undakyene ngita ndeni Yane na Yambile pevampinjile Musa. Avo ndi vanu vevihela luhala na valekile udikilo. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Ila seviwesa kwendelela hilo kwakuva lwa upufi vao wiwoneka pelu pee kwa vanu vonda, ngita peikali kwa Yane na Yambile.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagicho gya kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Ila veve ugamanyile mawulanicho gangu na lugendo lwangu na mahocho gangu na udikilo vangu, uhuvililo vangu na lukelo lwangu na uchindilo lwangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />magudo na utumama. Veve ukugachela makani gyonda gegandipandile ukoya ku Anitiokia na ku Ikono na ku Lisitila. Ndikahuvilile magudo golofu hilo na Mtwa akandilowa munjowo ichi chonda. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Munu yeyonda yeing'ang'a kwikala kwa kumkelesa Nguluvi kwa kwiwunga na Kilisito Yesu, ing'ang'wa agudiswe. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Ila vanu vawofu na vachanga vikwendelela kuva vanjanganifu hilo, vakivachanga vanu vangi na vawo kuchangwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Ila veve sigale mu undakyene wula weuwulanichwe weudikile. Wichela vala vevakali vawulanichi vako, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />nave wikwiwuka kuva kuvangila uwana vako ugachele Masimbo ga Nguluvi gyegiwesa kukugavila uginyange veuleta ulowa kwa ngasi lya kumdikila Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Masimbo gonda gya Nguluvi gasimbilwe kwa ulongochi va Nguluvi na gikwidikilwa kwa kuwulanichila undakyene, kuvayakilila vanu nongwa chawo na kuvalongochela vanu vikale kwa unofu, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />neke munu va Nguluvi aveche na udikilwe na ahaguliwe kwa kugita kasi yeyonda nofu.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Ndikuswitilicha pautalo lya Nguluvi na pautalo lya Kilisito Yesu yedakuvahiga nongwa vanu vevagehe wumi na yevafuwe na kwajili lya ekwacha kwa mwene na kwajili lya Ung'achale vake, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />dalike luchowo lwa Nguluvi, kwa chipindi kyeking'ang'wa awu seking'ang'wa, kanile na lakilile na kuvanamacha vanu kwa luhuvililo vonda kwa kuvawulanicha unofu. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Daukwacha chipindi vanu dasevipulikicha mawulanicho gya undakyene, ila vifwata ludoboko lwao na kwikong'asila vawulanichi volofu vevikuvalongela njowo chila ambacho masigicha gyao daging'ang'a kugapulika. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Vikana kupulika undakyene na davafwata mahumulilo gesegivatanga. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Ila veve uveche meho mu chipindi chonda na uhuvile magudo na ugite kasi lya kudalika Njowo Nofu, ugite unofu ku unyigendwa vako vonda. <verse eid="2TI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Ndikulongela aga kwakuva nene ndigehe pepi kuhechwa ngita usembe va kusukulwa kwa danda na chipindi cha kufuwa kwa nene kifikile. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Nditovile fita unofu na lunyilo ndimalile na udikilo ndiudimile, <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />nondee isigiye hela kugavilwa fupo kwa kwikala kwa unofu, ambayo Mtwa muhiga nogwa va undakyene akunigavila kigono kila, se nene hela, ata vangi vonda vevichindila kwa lukelo va kwacha kwa mwene.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagicho ga kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Gangamache kwacha kwa nene kisatu, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />kwakuva Dema akakeliye makani gya muinyi akandilekile na kuhelela ku Tesalonike. Na mwene Kilesike akahele ku Galatia na Tito akahele ku Dalamatiya. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka weka hela ndi asigalie baha na nene. Wache na Maliko, kwakuva ivecha anitange mukasi lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Ndikamlagiliche Tukiko ukoya ku Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Pewikwacha ndetele likoti lyangu litali lyendililekile ukoya Tiloya kwa Kalipo, ndetele na figanulo fyangu fyefigonjoka hilo fila figanulo fyefigitilwe kwa ngwembe. <verse eid="2TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alekisanda, yula muhongola finu fya fesa andigitie unjanangifu wolofu, Mtwa damuhomba kuhumila na magito gyake. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Umulolele hilo munu uyo, kwakuva akaupinjile hilo unanzi vetu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Chipindi cha kwanja pendikwitasile kwihela munu yeimile lubali lwangu, vonda vakanilekile. Ndikumlumba Nguluvi abihile kuvalila nogwa iyo. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Ila Mtwa ekalile pamwi na nene, akanigavila ludali lwa kudalika luchowo lyake mu undakyene vonda, vanu se Vayawudi vaupulike, kangi ndikalowolwe kuhuma mu kufuwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Mtwa dakundilowa na njowo chonda cha uwofu, akuninyamula unofu mbaka mu ung'achale vake va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Ukomi ugehe na mwene mbepali na mbepali, Ndakyene.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luhungilo lwa kumalila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Vahungilage Pilisila na Akula, pamwi na mwato va Onesifolo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Elasito akasigaliye ku Kolinito na mwene Tilofimo ndikamlekile ku Mileto kwakuva akali itamika. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Nondee, ugite kisatu kwacha ikiva yave chipindi kya ng'ala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ebulo na Pudenisi na Lino na Kilaudiyo vakuhungila na vakolo vangi vonda.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Mtwa aveche pamwi na veve.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Usangi vake uveche na nyenye.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>